                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3e5536e1-507c-3341-b908-8ff436086cf2",
                        "entry_id": "df29135f-af4b-3658-960b-b53170fa3ecd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг., неодобр. быть фанфароном, вести себя как фанфарон; хвастаться, бахвалиться"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "549eabb2-0108-4d67-8b26-26b664186d09",
                                "sense_id": "3e5536e1-507c-3341-b908-8ff436086cf2",
                                "text": "В последний год его в нашей школе ему досталось наследство, двести душ, а так как у нас все почти были бедные, то он даже перед нами стал фанфаронить."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "10b90e6d-c3b6-4aae-ab4e-d1aa03e2888c",
                        "source_entry_id": "df29135f-af4b-3658-960b-b53170fa3ecd",
                        "source_sense_id": "3e5536e1-507c-3341-b908-8ff436086cf2",
                        "target_lang_word": "brag",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "brag",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92d52b84-0e61-3758-9c14-af9772ba33c1",
                                        "entry_id": "30be986c-a777-3490-8c96-185959bb4a5f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A boast or boasting; bragging; ostentatious pretence or self-glorification."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1bfb40cb-731d-4f6c-9632-947216ff3322",
                                                "sense_id": "92d52b84-0e61-3758-9c14-af9772ba33c1",
                                                "text": "Caesar […] made not here his brag / Of \"came\", and \"saw\", and \"overcame\"."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4df377ef-a91e-306b-a095-0091572d10ad",
                                        "entry_id": "30be986c-a777-3490-8c96-185959bb4a5f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The thing which is boasted of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03b0d222-d457-47cc-8d64-a2c48edd2e22",
                                                "sense_id": "4df377ef-a91e-306b-a095-0091572d10ad",
                                                "text": "Beauty is Nature's brag.",
                                                "translation": "Comus",
                                                "english": "Comus"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "30494ca0-92a0-4cff-a732-3dc1dbc49499",
                                                "sense_id": "4df377ef-a91e-306b-a095-0091572d10ad",
                                                "text": "You could just use ordinary shop-bought kecap manis to marinade the meat, but making your own is easy, has a far more elegant fragrance and is, above all, such a great brag! Flavouring kecap manis is an intensely personal thing, so try this version now and next time cook the sauce down with crushed, split lemongrass and a shredded lime leaf."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "90a652fd-159a-381f-aed7-15f3d614d881",
                                        "entry_id": "30be986c-a777-3490-8c96-185959bb4a5f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Short for three card brag."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3389bc95-62b4-441a-af27-95c23712b4e3",
                                                "sense_id": "90a652fd-159a-381f-aed7-15f3d614d881",
                                                "text": "our mixed companies here, which, if they happen to rise above bragg and whist, infallibly stop short of every thing either pleasing or instructive"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "brag",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0b4e46c8-45f7-3120-a00a-eb59f912fd55",
                                        "entry_id": "88121459-fc57-31aa-a816-7e9483eca334",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To boast; to talk with excessive pride about what one has, is able to do, or has done; often as an attempt to popularize oneself."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive",
                                            "often",
                                            "with-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61d1ec6c-a7de-47c8-95bf-495976277ad9",
                                                "sense_id": "0b4e46c8-45f7-3120-a00a-eb59f912fd55",
                                                "text": "to brag of one’s exploits, courage, or money"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f44f5535-558c-4c16-b597-f99459407cc7",
                                                "sense_id": "0b4e46c8-45f7-3120-a00a-eb59f912fd55",
                                                "text": "Conceit, more rich in matter than in words, / Brags of his substance, not of ornament. / Nor shall Death brag thou wander’st in his shade"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "brag",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c3a96c11-ac99-33b2-a00d-f3aeb4ca3b46",
                                        "entry_id": "d3040a7b-d40c-352e-ba2e-6982b6a325e9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Excellent; first-rate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f276ae0-75be-3ed8-a4c3-aacbac158172",
                                        "entry_id": "d3040a7b-d40c-352e-ba2e-6982b6a325e9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Brisk; full of spirits; boasting; pretentious; conceited."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a35133ac-03ad-4a44-8367-96fdaca29518",
                                                "sense_id": "4f276ae0-75be-3ed8-a4c3-aacbac158172",
                                                "text": "a woundy, brag young fellow"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "brag",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "217ace52-90a5-3f05-b50f-f545408d825a",
                                        "entry_id": "ff5f552e-48a3-3d90-8b22-06e0e794e286",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Proudly; boastfully."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df238a36-6c90-4417-b600-19e2dff599f0",
                                                "sense_id": "217ace52-90a5-3f05-b50f-f545408d825a",
                                                "text": "Seest how brag yond bullock beare […]his pricked eares?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "649198a8-4979-4113-a16e-0b8c55f6c0e4",
                        "source_entry_id": "df29135f-af4b-3658-960b-b53170fa3ecd",
                        "source_sense_id": "3e5536e1-507c-3341-b908-8ff436086cf2",
                        "target_lang_word": "boast",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "boast",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f841bef3-8e63-35f2-865d-3d578f617ce5",
                                        "entry_id": "f09db8b2-b4b8-34ec-9049-c88cb33fd944",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A brag; ostentatious positive appraisal of oneself."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3757ce1e-caae-3aaf-a7f7-6883488e6b3e",
                                        "entry_id": "f09db8b2-b4b8-34ec-9049-c88cb33fd944",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that one brags about."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9679de6-4f2f-4ae2-978a-fe817790e61f",
                                                "sense_id": "3757ce1e-caae-3aaf-a7f7-6883488e6b3e",
                                                "text": "It was his regular boast that he could eat two full English breakfasts in one sitting."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d0eb274-7651-3104-a195-d9477a1e5773",
                                        "entry_id": "f09db8b2-b4b8-34ec-9049-c88cb33fd944",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A shot where the ball is driven off a side wall and then strikes the front wall."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "boast",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5da4897a-1773-3740-a75a-251c7930ede1",
                                        "entry_id": "374ad0d3-a560-3a8e-9a09-5dc4b2826701",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To brag; to talk loudly in praise of oneself."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ccb2d4c-953e-4828-ac7f-c63703f78a68",
                                                "sense_id": "5da4897a-1773-3740-a75a-251c7930ede1",
                                                "text": "On no account will he or any other kind be able to boast that he's escaped the pursuit of those who can follow so detailed and comprehensive a method of enquiry."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5bc9aa9e-2364-338e-8316-047f87fabcc1",
                                        "entry_id": "374ad0d3-a560-3a8e-9a09-5dc4b2826701",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(used with \\\"about\\\" or \\\"of\\\") To speak of with pride, vanity, or exultation, with a view to self-commendation; to extol."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef7421f2-b445-4d44-9606-25748931c567",
                                                "sense_id": "5bc9aa9e-2364-338e-8316-047f87fabcc1",
                                                "text": "Lest bad men should boast / Their specious deeds."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2d81846-9125-4ce3-a081-a88173e8492a",
                                                "sense_id": "5bc9aa9e-2364-338e-8316-047f87fabcc1",
                                                "text": "The dirty secret of the internet is that all this distraction and interruption is immensely profitable. Web companies like to boast about \"creating compelling content\", or offering services that let you \"stay up to date with what your friends are doing\",[…]and so on. But the real way to build a successful online business is to be better than your rivals at undermining people's control of their own attention."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "244aba9f-d8f9-3753-9d3f-fba0e7b04b29",
                                        "entry_id": "374ad0d3-a560-3a8e-9a09-5dc4b2826701",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To speak in exulting language of another; to glory; to exult."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f81c3fc-80f3-49ff-82f1-63f2faf3614c",
                                                "sense_id": "244aba9f-d8f9-3753-9d3f-fba0e7b04b29",
                                                "text": "In God we boast all the day long."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b8ace6dc-6197-341e-a747-67adb07abb80",
                                        "entry_id": "374ad0d3-a560-3a8e-9a09-5dc4b2826701",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To play a boast shot."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dae672a8-3d3f-3d41-8d8f-6cd7557a8229",
                                        "entry_id": "374ad0d3-a560-3a8e-9a09-5dc4b2826701",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To possess (a special and desirable quality)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e278322-fda7-4059-a438-2e0bd257581c",
                                                "sense_id": "dae672a8-3d3f-3d41-8d8f-6cd7557a8229",
                                                "text": "The hotel boasts one of the best views of the sea."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d189ebcb-b17f-453a-b25f-93efcb9c6e28",
                                                "sense_id": "dae672a8-3d3f-3d41-8d8f-6cd7557a8229",
                                                "text": "His family boasted a famous name."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2100205-1de0-4857-8d54-e736e577f5d1",
                                                "sense_id": "dae672a8-3d3f-3d41-8d8f-6cd7557a8229",
                                                "text": "Jinhua and others are spending big to get there. In Jinjiang, a city in Fujian Province once known as a shoe-manufacturing center, Jinhua’s new factory is almost finished. Rising five stories and stretching several football fields long, the structure boasts 100,000 square feet of new office space."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c833b7c-52e4-4e7c-bf8e-132ffd369d88",
                                                "sense_id": "dae672a8-3d3f-3d41-8d8f-6cd7557a8229",
                                                "text": "After dropping off travellers at Foregate Street, my train terminates at Shrub Hill - a station which boasts one of the best selection [sic] of semaphore signals left in the country."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
